[1.103568, "o", "  railmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded upstream:\r\n"]
[1.121662, "o", "  1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to LocalHistoryView.wheel.\r\n"]
[1.139791, "o", "  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls\r\n"]
[1.157871, "o", "  _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction with render_history=True and forwarded_input=b\"\" —\r\n"]
[1.175959, "o", "  no upstream input.\r\n"]
[1.194261, "o", "  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing\r\n"]
[1.212413, "o", "  reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-side via surface.paint_overlays.\r\n"]
[1.23065, "o", "  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-mode; the\r\n"]
[1.248728, "o", "  implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode, which is deliberately avoided.\r\n"]
[1.266889, "o", "  Focused test:\r\n"]
[1.285127, "o", "  tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel\r\n"]
[1.303172, "o", "  asserts agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\r\n"]
[1.321109, "o", "  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay rendered rather\r\n"]
[1.339168, "o", "\u001b[1;20r\u001b[20;1H\n\u001b[A  than merely dropping the event.\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[1;21r\u001b[20;1H"]
